{"name":"Endive","hex":"#cee1c8","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"endive","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A leafy salad vegetable, Cichorium endivia, which is often confused with common chicory (Cichorium intybus)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/endive"}],"entries":[{"title":"Endive","blocks":[{"text":"Endive is a leaf vegetable belonging to the genus Cichorium, which includes several similar bitter-leafed vegetables. Species include Cichorium endivia, Cichorium pumilum, and Cichorium intybus. Chicory includes types such as radicchio, puntarelle, and Belgian endive."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/00/Cichorium_endivia_-_Botanischer_Garten_Mainz_IMG_5453.JPG/330px-Cichorium_endivia_-_Botanischer_Garten_Mainz_IMG_5453.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Endive"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Cicoria-otrantina.jpg/500px-Cicoria-otrantina.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Cicoria-otrantina.jpg/500px-Cicoria-otrantina.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"An heirloom endive cultivar of species Cichorium intybus","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACicoria-otrantina.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Friseesalat1_%28fcm%29.jpg/250px-Friseesalat1_%28fcm%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Friseesalat1_%28fcm%29.jpg/500px-Friseesalat1_%28fcm%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Friseesalat1_%28fcm%29.jpg/250px-Friseesalat1_%28fcm%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.o